@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam svgLinkTarget _top
top to bottom direction
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F4F7FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #57718A
title CTA 2 TMEM allocation / 512-column request
state "尚未分配" as s0
note right of s0
no live allocation yet
end note
state "该CTA释放前置条件成立" as s1
note right of s1
local handshake path completed; leader drain premise established
locally or inherited through peer acknowledgement
end note
state "本CTA已进入free" as s2
note right of s2
paired operation required; own enter alone does not prove
deallocation
end note
state "对应TMEM已由dealloc释放" as s3
note right of s3
not an output-D completion or Host-visibility event
end note
state "已分配；分配许可仍持有" as s4
note right of s4
allocation live; per-stage read/write protocol separate
end note
state "已放弃再分配许可；内存仍存活" as s5
note right of s5
no subsequent alloc by this CTA; no deallocation implied
end note
s0 --> s4 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta2.allocate tmem.transition.029\nAllocator2Sm::allocate(512, &base) · 指定效果满足\nvalid paired warp participation]]
s4 --> s5 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta2.release_permit tmem.transition.030\nrelease_allocation_lock() · 指定效果满足]]
s5 --> s1 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta2.arrive795 tmem.transition.031\ndealloc arrive(peer, leader) · 调用返回\nleader tail has returned directly (leader) or its premise is\ninherited from leader795 (peer)]]
s1 --> s2 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta2.free tmem.transition.032\nAllocator2Sm::free(base,512) · 调用进入\nproper peer warp participation remains required]]
s2 --> s3 : [[../index.html?protocol=dense.protocol_draft.tmem_lifetime&event=tmem.cta2.free tmem.transition.033\nAllocator2Sm::free(base,512) · 指定效果满足\nnot inferred from free.enter alone; does not imply relative\nAPI-return order between peer CTAs]]
legend bottom
资源状态不等于函数调用栈。每条状态转换单独保留触发事件与前置条件。
本图是固定源码与条件的契约模型，不是本轮GPU执行轨迹。
endlegend
